# Environment files are never committed. `.env.example` is the contract:
# it lists every name with a placeholder, and is the only env file in git.
# Real values live in the provider's store — Cloudflare Worker secrets,
# Supabase function secrets, or GitHub Actions secrets. See
# handoff/04-environment-contract.md.
# Enforced by scripts/check-env-safety.mjs in CI.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

